3. What is not included
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Your memory (the banks, and the files of the other tools it reads, which are named in the README) is never copied into this
repository or sent anywhere. Those tools' names identify the data this plugin reads; their owners do not endorse or
maintain it.
